From f5a05c94c3b54737690ade82cc1129136e4bd64b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Simon Veitner <sveitner@redhat.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 13:54:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] [Bugfix][DeepSeek V4] Load redundant EPLB expert slots

get_expert_mapping did not pass num_redundant_experts, so with EPLB and
num_redundant_experts > 0 the redundant physical expert slots were
never loaded by load_weights.

Run DeepSeek-V4-Flash with EPLB and 8 redundant experts in the nightly
GSM8K job. Right after startup, a worker extension checks over
/collective_rpc that every redundant expert slot holds the same weights
as its source expert.

Signed-off-by: Simon Veitner <sveitner@redhat.com>
